sted.","execution":"Computation is fixed and identical across all four groups. compute() executes the supplied correct computation and returns result, charging its full interpreter cost. Your compute field is ignored. Generate effects that choose cache or compute and execute remaining obligations. At runtime support is a variable containing fresh certified state information.","fixed_compute":"data = read('/input/data')
